      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgb(94, 42, 42)" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>案例档案</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="126" width="272" height="40">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="34" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgb(176, 122, 46)" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>460 mg/L</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="170" width="272" height="20">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(122, 116, 106)" wrap="false"><p>历史最大值，出现在 1980-07</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="206" width="272" height="220">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(38, 34, 29)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.65">
        <p>· 仅 28 个月有观测，序列极稀疏</p>
        <p>· mean 58.2 / median 6.8，均值被少数高值拉起</p>
        <p>· 另有 450（1980-10）、212、160 等尖峰</p>
        <p>· DOC &gt; 50 共 6 个月，全部落在 1978–1980</p>
        <p>· 1978–1980（n=11）：均值 137.5、中位 53</p>
        <p>· 其余年份（n=17）：均值仅 6.9</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="356" topLeftY="92" width="276" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgb(94, 42, 42)" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>排查：常见解释全部无信号</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="356" topLeftY="130" width="276" height="290">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(38, 34, 29)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p><span bold="true">流量　</span>Spearman(DOC, Q) ≈ 0，p = 0.99，与月均流量不相关</p>
        <p><span bold="true">上游　</span>上游站 06437000 同期始终为低 DOC，无传导来源</p>
        <p><span bold="true">协变量　</span>pH、电导率、水温均无解释力</p>
        <p><span bold="true">时间　</span>高值只存在于 1970s 末局部时段，之后再未出现</p>
        <p><span bold="true">推断　</span>月均尺度特征无法编码这段局部历史高 DOC regime</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="664" topLeftY="92" width="248" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgb(94, 42, 42)" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>结论与处理方式</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="664" topLeftY="130" width="248" height="180">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(38, 34, 29)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p>· 欠预测源于输入信息缺失，而非模型容量不足</p>
        <p>· 论文表述为「可解释的系统性欠预测」</p>
        <p>· 不追求逐点拟合这类极端值</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="664" startY="318" endX="912" endY="318"><border color="rgb(228, 222, 209)" width="1"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="664" topLeftY="330" width="248" height="100">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(38, 34, 29)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgb(176, 122, 46)">改为　</span>预测区间等不确定性量化，并对历史 regime 加标记，避免均值指标掩盖结构性误差。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="48" startY="450" endX="912" endY="450"><border color="rgb(216, 209, 192)" width="1"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="462" width="864" height="40">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgb(94, 42, 42)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>方法论含义：先审计误差结构、再决定是否改模型——把「模型学不会」与「输入信息里本来就没有」严格区分开。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="48" startY="508" endX="912" endY="508"><border color="rgb(201, 192, 172)" width="1"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="514" width="560" height="16">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(150, 143, 130)" wrap="false"><p>审计：experiments/analysis/extreme/P0_label_audit_06438000.md、P1_covariate_check_06438000.md</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="800" topLeftY="514" width="112" height="16">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(150, 143, 130)" textAlign="right" wrap="false"><p>15 / 18</p></content>
